  "proposal": {
    "summary": "Adds an integration regression test for PlanStep.clone() to verify that the `protected` flag remains true and original fields are unchanged. The test imports `arkhe_agent::PlanStep` and includes a simple #[test] that clones a PlanStep instance and asserts its properties.\n\n```rust\nuse arkhe_agent::PlanStep;\n\n#[test]\nfn plan_step_clone_preserves_protected_flag() {\n    let original = PlanStep {\n        step_id: \"step1\".to_string(),\n        action: \"do_something\".to_string(),\n        protected: true,\n    };\n    let cloned = original.clone();\n    assert_eq!(original.step_id, cloned.step_id);\n    assert_eq!(original.action, cloned.action);\n    assert!(original.protected);\n    assert!(cloned.protected);\n}\n```\n\nThe test is placed in `cognition/arkhe-agent/tests/development_regression.rs` and does not modify any source files.\n\n",
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "cognition/arkhe-agent/tests/development_regression.rs",
        "content": "use arkhe_agent::PlanStep;\n\n#[test]\nfn plan_step_clone_preserves_protected_flag() {\n    let original = PlanStep {\n        step_id: \"step1\".to_string(),\n        action: \"do_something\".to_string(),\n        protected: true,\n    };\n    let cloned = original.clone();\n    assert_eq!(original.step_id, cloned.step_id);\n    assert_eq!(original.action, cloned.action);\n    assert!(original.protected);\n    assert!(cloned.protected);\n}"
      }
    ]
  },
